{"seq":3,"slug":"ui-animation","title":"UI 动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-ui/ui-animation","wordCount":894,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"ui-动画\">UI 动画</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>UI 动画是提升游戏交互体验的关键要素，包括面板滑入滑出、按钮悬停反馈、数值滚动变化、弹窗缩放弹出等视觉效果。Unity 提供了多种实现 UI 动画的方案，从内置的 Animator 组件到代码驱动的 Tween 动画，每种方案在灵活性、性能和开发效率上各有侧重。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph UI 动画方案&#10;        A[Animator 状态机] --&gt;|关键帧驱动| B[Animation Clip]&#10;        C[DOTween 补间库] --&gt;|代码驱动| D[属性插值]&#10;        E[协程动画] --&gt;|手动计算| F[逐帧更新]&#10;        G[USS Transition] --&gt;|声明式| H[样式过渡]&#10;    end&#10;    B --&gt; I[适合复杂序列]&#10;    D --&gt; J[适合简单补间]&#10;    F --&gt; K[适合自定义曲线]&#10;    H --&gt; L[适合 UI Toolkit]\">graph TD\n    subgraph UI 动画方案\n        A[Animator 状态机] --&gt;|关键帧驱动| B[Animation Clip]\n        C[DOTween 补间库] --&gt;|代码驱动| D[属性插值]\n        E[协程动画] --&gt;|手动计算| F[逐帧更新]\n        G[USS Transition] --&gt;|声明式| H[样式过渡]\n    end\n    B --&gt; I[适合复杂序列]\n    D --&gt; J[适合简单补间]\n    F --&gt; K[适合自定义曲线]\n    H --&gt; L[适合 UI Toolkit]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动画方案</th>\n<th>开发效率</th>\n<th>运行性能</th>\n<th>灵活性</th>\n<th>GC 分配</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Animator + Animation</td>\n<td>高（可视化编辑）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>复杂动画序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DOTween</td>\n<td>高（链式API）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低（缓存模式）</td>\n<td>简单补间动画</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协程手写</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>需缓存 yield</td>\n<td>自定义需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CanvasGroup 渐变</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>面板淡入淡出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>USS Transition</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>UI Toolkit 专用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"animator-驱动的-ui-动画\">Animator 驱动的 UI 动画</h2><p>Animator 组件可以直接驱动 UI 元素的 RectTransform、CanvasGroup 等属性。通过 Animation 窗口录制关键帧，在 Animator Controller 中组织状态机，实现复杂的 UI 动画序列。这种方式对设计师友好，动画调节无需修改代码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;&#10;public class PanelAnimator : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private Animator animator;&#10;    [SerializeField] private CanvasGroup canvasGroup;&#10;&#10;    private static readonly int ShowHash = Animator.StringToHash(&quot;Show&quot;);&#10;    private static readonly int HideHash = Animator.StringToHash(&quot;Hide&quot;);&#10;    private static readonly int IsVisibleHash = Animator.StringToHash(&quot;IsVisible&quot;);&#10;&#10;    private bool isVisible;&#10;&#10;    public void Show()&#10;    {&#10;        if (isVisible) return;&#10;        isVisible = true;&#10;&#10;        gameObject.SetActive(true);&#10;        canvasGroup.interactable = true;&#10;        canvasGroup.blocksRaycasts = true;&#10;        animator.SetBool(IsVisibleHash, true);&#10;        animator.SetTrigger(ShowHash);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void Hide()&#10;    {&#10;        if (!isVisible) return;&#10;        isVisible = false;&#10;&#10;        canvasGroup.interactable = false;&#10;        canvasGroup.blocksRaycasts = false;&#10;        animator.SetBool(IsVisibleHash, false);&#10;        animator.SetTrigger(HideHash);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void OnHideAnimationComplete()&#10;    {&#10;        gameObject.SetActive(false);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class PanelAnimator : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Animator animator;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private CanvasGroup canvasGroup;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private static readonly int ShowHash = Animator.StringToHash(\"Show\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private static readonly int HideHash = Animator.StringToHash(\"Hide\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private static readonly int IsVisibleHash = Animator.StringToHash(\"IsVisible\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private bool isVisible;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Show()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (isVisible) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        isVisible = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        gameObject.SetActive(true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        canvasGroup.interactable = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        canvasGroup.blocksRaycasts = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animator.SetBool(IsVisibleHash, true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animator.SetTrigger(ShowHash);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Hide()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!isVisible) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        isVisible = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        canvasGroup.interactable = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        canvasGroup.blocksRaycasts = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animator.SetBool(IsVisibleHash, false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animator.SetTrigger(HideHash);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void OnHideAnimationComplete()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        gameObject.SetActive(false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Animator 控制 UI 动画时，建议将 Animator 的 Update Mode 设置为 Unscaled Time，这样在游戏暂停（<code>Time.timeScale = 0</code>）时 UI 动画仍然能正常播放，常见于暂停菜单和设置界面。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Animator 设置</th>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Update Mode</td>\n<td>Unscaled Time</td>\n<td>不受 timeScale 影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Culling Mode</td>\n<td>Always Animate</td>\n<td>不可见时仍更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apply Root Motion</td>\n<td>关闭</td>\n<td>UI 不需要根运动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Has Exit Time</td>\n<td>按需</td>\n<td>淡出动画需要退出时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码驱动的补间动画\">代码驱动的补间动画</h2><p>补间动画（Tween）通过代码在两个值之间进行平滑插值，是 UI 动画最灵活的实现方式。无论使用第三方库还是自己实现，核心原理都是在 Update 或协程中对属性进行插值计算。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using System;&#10;using System.Collections;&#10;&#10;public class UITweenEngine : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    public static UITweenEngine Instance { get; private set; }&#10;&#10;    private void Awake()&#10;    {&#10;        Instance = this;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public Coroutine TweenFloat(float from, float to, float duration,&#10;        Action&lt;float&gt; onUpdate, Action onComplete = null,&#10;        Func&lt;float, float&gt; easeFunc = null)&#10;    {&#10;        return StartCoroutine(TweenRoutine(from, to, duration, onUpdate, onComplete, easeFunc));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private IEnumerator TweenRoutine(float from, float to, float duration,&#10;        Action&lt;float&gt; onUpdate, Action onComplete,&#10;        Func&lt;float, float&gt; easeFunc)&#10;    {&#10;        float elapsed = 0f;&#10;        easeFunc ??= EaseInOutCubic;&#10;&#10;        while (elapsed &lt; duration)&#10;        {&#10;            elapsed += Time.unscaledDeltaTime;&#10;            float t = Mathf.Clamp01(elapsed / duration);&#10;            float easedT = easeFunc(t);&#10;            float value = Mathf.LerpUnclamped(from, to, easedT);&#10;            onUpdate(value);&#10;            yield return null;&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        onUpdate(to);&#10;        onComplete?.Invoke();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public static float EaseInOutCubic(float t)&#10;    {&#10;        return t &lt; 0.5f ? 4f * t * t * t : 1f - Mathf.Pow(-2f * t + 2f, 3f) / 2f;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public static float EaseOutBack(float t)&#10;    {&#10;        const float c1 = 1.70158f;&#10;        const float c3 = c1 + 1f;&#10;        return 1f + c3 * Mathf.Pow(t - 1f, 3f) + c1 * Mathf.Pow(t - 1f, 2f);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public static float EaseOutElastic(float t)&#10;    {&#10;        if (t &lt;= 0f) return 0f;&#10;        if (t &gt;= 1f) return 1f;&#10;        const float c4 = 2f * Mathf.PI / 3f;&#10;        return Mathf.Pow(2f, -10f * t) * Mathf.Sin((t * 10f - 0.75f) * c4) + 1f;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Collections;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class UITweenEngine : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static UITweenEngine Instance { get; private set; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Awake()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Instance = this;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Coroutine TweenFloat(float from, float to, float duration,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Action&#x3C;float> onUpdate, Action onComplete = null,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Func&#x3C;float, float> easeFunc = null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return StartCoroutine(TweenRoutine(from, to, duration, onUpdate, onComplete, easeFunc));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private IEnumerator TweenRoutine(float from, float to, float duration,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Action&#x3C;float> onUpdate, Action onComplete,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Func&#x3C;float, float> easeFunc)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float elapsed = 0f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        easeFunc ??= EaseInOutCubic;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        while (elapsed &#x3C; duration)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            elapsed += Time.unscaledDeltaTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            float t = Mathf.Clamp01(elapsed / duration);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            float easedT = easeFunc(t);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            float value = Mathf.LerpUnclamped(from, to, easedT);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onUpdate(value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            yield return null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onUpdate(to);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onComplete?.Invoke();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static float EaseInOutCubic(float t)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return t &#x3C; 0.5f ? 4f * t * t * t : 1f - Mathf.Pow(-2f * t + 2f, 3f) / 2f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static float EaseOutBack(float t)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        const float c1 = 1.70158f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        const float c3 = c1 + 1f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return 1f + c3 * Mathf.Pow(t - 1f, 3f) + c1 * Mathf.Pow(t - 1f, 2f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static float EaseOutElastic(float t)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (t &#x3C;= 0f) return 0f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (t >= 1f) return 1f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        const float c4 = 2f * Mathf.PI / 3f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Mathf.Pow(2f, -10f * t) * Mathf.Sin((t * 10f - 0.75f) * c4) + 1f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 缓动函数效果&#10;        A[Linear 线性] --&gt; B[匀速运动]&#10;        C[EaseInOut 缓入缓出] --&gt; D[先慢后快再慢]&#10;        E[EaseOutBack 回弹] --&gt; F[超出后回弹]&#10;        G[EaseOutElastic 弹性] --&gt; H[弹簧振荡]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 缓动函数效果\n        A[Linear 线性] --&gt; B[匀速运动]\n        C[EaseInOut 缓入缓出] --&gt; D[先慢后快再慢]\n        E[EaseOutBack 回弹] --&gt; F[超出后回弹]\n        G[EaseOutElastic 弹性] --&gt; H[弹簧振荡]\n    end</pre><p>使用补间引擎实现常见的 UI 动画效果：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using UnityEngine.UI;&#10;&#10;public class UIAnimations : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private RectTransform panel;&#10;    [SerializeField] private CanvasGroup canvasGroup;&#10;    [SerializeField] private Text scoreText;&#10;&#10;    public void SlideIn()&#10;    {&#10;        panel.anchoredPosition = new Vector2(-Screen.width, 0);&#10;        canvasGroup.alpha = 0f;&#10;&#10;        UITweenEngine.Instance.TweenFloat(&#10;            -Screen.width, 0f, 0.4f,&#10;            v =&gt; panel.anchoredPosition = new Vector2(v, 0f),&#10;            easeFunc: UITweenEngine.EaseOutBack&#10;        );&#10;&#10;        UITweenEngine.Instance.TweenFloat(&#10;            0f, 1f, 0.3f,&#10;            v =&gt; canvasGroup.alpha = v&#10;        );&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void PopIn()&#10;    {&#10;        panel.localScale = Vector3.zero;&#10;&#10;        UITweenEngine.Instance.TweenFloat(&#10;            0f, 1f, 0.5f,&#10;            v =&gt; panel.localScale = Vector3.one * v,&#10;            easeFunc: UITweenEngine.EaseOutElastic&#10;        );&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void AnimateScore(int from, int to)&#10;    {&#10;        UITweenEngine.Instance.TweenFloat(&#10;            from, to, 1f,&#10;            v =&gt; scoreText.text = Mathf.RoundToInt(v).ToString(&quot;N0&quot;),&#10;            easeFunc: UITweenEngine.EaseInOutCubic&#10;        );&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine.UI;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class UIAnimations : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private RectTransform panel;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private CanvasGroup canvasGroup;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Text scoreText;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void SlideIn()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        panel.anchoredPosition = new Vector2(-Screen.width, 0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        canvasGroup.alpha = 0f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        UITweenEngine.Instance.TweenFloat(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            -Screen.width, 0f, 0.4f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            v => panel.anchoredPosition = new Vector2(v, 0f),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            easeFunc: UITweenEngine.EaseOutBack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        UITweenEngine.Instance.TweenFloat(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            0f, 1f, 0.3f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            v => canvasGroup.alpha = v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void PopIn()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        panel.localScale = Vector3.zero;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        UITweenEngine.Instance.TweenFloat(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            0f, 1f, 0.5f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            v => panel.localScale = Vector3.one * v,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            easeFunc: UITweenEngine.EaseOutElastic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void AnimateScore(int from, int to)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        UITweenEngine.Instance.TweenFloat(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            from, to, 1f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            v => scoreText.text = Mathf.RoundToInt(v).ToString(\"N0\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            easeFunc: UITweenEngine.EaseInOutCubic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"canvasgroup-与批量控制\">CanvasGroup 与批量控制</h2><p>CanvasGroup 组件可以批量控制其下所有子元素的透明度、交互性和射线检测。它是实现面板淡入淡出的最简单方式，不需要遍历修改每个子元素的 alpha 值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using System.Collections;&#10;&#10;public class FadePanel : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private CanvasGroup canvasGroup;&#10;    [SerializeField] private float fadeDuration = 0.3f;&#10;&#10;    private Coroutine fadeCoroutine;&#10;&#10;    public void FadeIn()&#10;    {&#10;        gameObject.SetActive(true);&#10;        StartFade(0f, 1f, () =&gt;&#10;        {&#10;            canvasGroup.interactable = true;&#10;            canvasGroup.blocksRaycasts = true;&#10;        });&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void FadeOut()&#10;    {&#10;        canvasGroup.interactable = false;&#10;        canvasGroup.blocksRaycasts = false;&#10;        StartFade(1f, 0f, () =&gt; gameObject.SetActive(false));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void StartFade(float from, float to, System.Action onComplete)&#10;    {&#10;        if (fadeCoroutine != null) StopCoroutine(fadeCoroutine);&#10;        fadeCoroutine = StartCoroutine(FadeRoutine(from, to, onComplete));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private IEnumerator FadeRoutine(float from, float to, System.Action onComplete)&#10;    {&#10;        float elapsed = 0f;&#10;        canvasGroup.alpha = from;&#10;&#10;        while (elapsed &lt; fadeDuration)&#10;        {&#10;            elapsed += Time.unscaledDeltaTime;&#10;            canvasGroup.alpha = Mathf.Lerp(from, to, elapsed / fadeDuration);&#10;            yield return null;&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        canvasGroup.alpha = to;&#10;        onComplete?.Invoke();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Collections;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class FadePanel : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private CanvasGroup canvasGroup;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private float fadeDuration = 0.3f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Coroutine fadeCoroutine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void FadeIn()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        gameObject.SetActive(true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        StartFade(0f, 1f, () =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            canvasGroup.interactable = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            canvasGroup.blocksRaycasts = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void FadeOut()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        canvasGroup.interactable = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        canvasGroup.blocksRaycasts = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        StartFade(1f, 0f, () => gameObject.SetActive(false));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void StartFade(float from, float to, System.Action onComplete)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (fadeCoroutine != null) StopCoroutine(fadeCoroutine);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fadeCoroutine = StartCoroutine(FadeRoutine(from, to, onComplete));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private IEnumerator FadeRoutine(float from, float to, System.Action onComplete)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float elapsed = 0f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        canvasGroup.alpha = from;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        while (elapsed &#x3C; fadeDuration)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            elapsed += Time.unscaledDeltaTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            canvasGroup.alpha = Mathf.Lerp(from, to, elapsed / fadeDuration);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            yield return null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        canvasGroup.alpha = to;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onComplete?.Invoke();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CanvasGroup 的嵌套规则：子 CanvasGroup 的最终 alpha 是父子 alpha 值的乘积。利用这一特性可以实现层级化的透明度控制，如整个面板淡出时内部元素同步变化。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CanvasGroup 属性</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>alpha</td>\n<td>子元素透明度 (0~1)</td>\n<td>淡入淡出动画</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>interactable</td>\n<td>是否可交互</td>\n<td>禁用面板交互</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>blocksRaycasts</td>\n<td>是否阻挡射线</td>\n<td>穿透点击控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ignoreParentGroups</td>\n<td>忽略父级控制</td>\n<td>独立控制子面板</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ui-状态机与动画编排\">UI 状态机与动画编排</h2><p>复杂的 UI 系统通常需要管理多个面板之间的切换动画。通过状态机模式编排动画序列，确保切换过程中新面板的进入动画和旧面板的退出动画正确衔接。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using System.Collections;&#10;using System.Collections.Generic;&#10;&#10;public class UIPageManager : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [System.Serializable]&#10;    public class PageConfig&#10;    {&#10;        public string pageName;&#10;        public CanvasGroup canvasGroup;&#10;        public RectTransform rectTransform;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    [SerializeField] private List&lt;PageConfig&gt; pages;&#10;    [SerializeField] private float transitionDuration = 0.3f;&#10;    [SerializeField] private float slideOffset = 300f;&#10;&#10;    private int currentPageIndex = -1;&#10;    private bool isTransitioning;&#10;&#10;    public void SwitchToPage(int index)&#10;    {&#10;        if (isTransitioning || index == currentPageIndex) return;&#10;        if (index &lt; 0 || index &gt;= pages.Count) return;&#10;&#10;        StartCoroutine(TransitionRoutine(currentPageIndex, index));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private IEnumerator TransitionRoutine(int fromIndex, int toIndex)&#10;    {&#10;        isTransitioning = true;&#10;&#10;        var toPage = pages[toIndex];&#10;        toPage.canvasGroup.gameObject.SetActive(true);&#10;        toPage.canvasGroup.alpha = 0f;&#10;        toPage.rectTransform.anchoredPosition = new Vector2(slideOffset, 0f);&#10;&#10;        if (fromIndex &gt;= 0)&#10;        {&#10;            var fromPage = pages[fromIndex];&#10;            yield return StartCoroutine(AnimatePages(fromPage, toPage));&#10;            fromPage.canvasGroup.gameObject.SetActive(false);&#10;        }&#10;        else&#10;        {&#10;            yield return StartCoroutine(AnimateIn(toPage));&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        toPage.canvasGroup.interactable = true;&#10;        toPage.canvasGroup.blocksRaycasts = true;&#10;        currentPageIndex = toIndex;&#10;        isTransitioning = false;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private IEnumerator AnimatePages(PageConfig from, PageConfig to)&#10;    {&#10;        from.canvasGroup.interactable = false;&#10;        from.canvasGroup.blocksRaycasts = false;&#10;&#10;        float elapsed = 0f;&#10;&#10;        while (elapsed &lt; transitionDuration)&#10;        {&#10;            elapsed += Time.unscaledDeltaTime;&#10;            float t = Mathf.Clamp01(elapsed / transitionDuration);&#10;            float smooth = t * t * (3f - 2f * t);&#10;&#10;            from.canvasGroup.alpha = 1f - smooth;&#10;            from.rectTransform.anchoredPosition = new Vector2(-slideOffset * smooth, 0f);&#10;&#10;            to.canvasGroup.alpha = smooth;&#10;            to.rectTransform.anchoredPosition = new Vector2(slideOffset * (1f - smooth), 0f);&#10;&#10;            yield return null;&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        from.canvasGroup.alpha = 0f;&#10;        to.canvasGroup.alpha = 1f;&#10;        to.rectTransform.anchoredPosition = Vector2.zero;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private IEnumerator AnimateIn(PageConfig page)&#10;    {&#10;        float elapsed = 0f;&#10;&#10;        while (elapsed &lt; transitionDuration)&#10;        {&#10;            elapsed += Time.unscaledDeltaTime;&#10;            float t = Mathf.Clamp01(elapsed / transitionDuration);&#10;            float smooth = t * t * (3f - 2f * t);&#10;&#10;            page.canvasGroup.alpha = smooth;&#10;            page.rectTransform.anchoredPosition = new Vector2(slideOffset * (1f - smooth), 0f);&#10;&#10;            yield return null;&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        page.canvasGroup.alpha = 1f;&#10;        page.rectTransform.anchoredPosition = Vector2.zero;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Collections;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Collections.Generic;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class UIPageManager : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [System.Serializable]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public class PageConfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        public string pageName;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        public CanvasGroup canvasGroup;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        public RectTransform rectTransform;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private List&#x3C;PageConfig> pages;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private float transitionDuration = 0.3f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private float slideOffset = 300f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private int currentPageIndex = -1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private bool isTransitioning;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void SwitchToPage(int index)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (isTransitioning || index == currentPageIndex) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (index &#x3C; 0 || index >= pages.Count) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        StartCoroutine(TransitionRoutine(currentPageIndex, index));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private IEnumerator TransitionRoutine(int fromIndex, int toIndex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        isTransitioning = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var toPage = pages[toIndex];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        toPage.canvasGroup.gameObject.SetActive(true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        toPage.canvasGroup.alpha = 0f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        toPage.rectTransform.anchoredPosition = new Vector2(slideOffset, 0f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (fromIndex >= 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            var fromPage = pages[fromIndex];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            yield return StartCoroutine(AnimatePages(fromPage, toPage));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            fromPage.canvasGroup.gameObject.SetActive(false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            yield return StartCoroutine(AnimateIn(toPage));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        toPage.canvasGroup.interactable = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        toPage.canvasGroup.blocksRaycasts = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentPageIndex = toIndex;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        isTransitioning = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private IEnumerator AnimatePages(PageConfig from, PageConfig to)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        from.canvasGroup.interactable = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        from.canvasGroup.blocksRaycasts = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float elapsed = 0f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        while (elapsed &#x3C; transitionDuration)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            elapsed += Time.unscaledDeltaTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            float t = Mathf.Clamp01(elapsed / transitionDuration);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            float smooth = t * t * (3f - 2f * t);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            from.canvasGroup.alpha = 1f - smooth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            from.rectTransform.anchoredPosition = new Vector2(-slideOffset * smooth, 0f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            to.canvasGroup.alpha = smooth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            to.rectTransform.anchoredPosition = new Vector2(slideOffset * (1f - smooth), 0f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            yield return null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        from.canvasGroup.alpha = 0f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        to.canvasGroup.alpha = 1f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        to.rectTransform.anchoredPosition = Vector2.zero;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private IEnumerator AnimateIn(PageConfig page)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float elapsed = 0f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        while (elapsed &#x3C; transitionDuration)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            elapsed += Time.unscaledDeltaTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            float t = Mathf.Clamp01(elapsed / transitionDuration);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            float smooth = t * t * (3f - 2f * t);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            page.canvasGroup.alpha = smooth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            page.rectTransform.anchoredPosition = new Vector2(slideOffset * (1f - smooth), 0f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            yield return null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        page.canvasGroup.alpha = 1f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        page.rectTransform.anchoredPosition = Vector2.zero;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph UI 页面切换状态机&#10;        A[空闲状态] --&gt;|SwitchToPage| B{是否有当前页}&#10;        B --&gt;|有| C[旧页退出 + 新页进入]&#10;        B --&gt;|无| D[新页直接进入]&#10;        C --&gt; E[旧页禁用]&#10;        E --&gt; A&#10;        D --&gt; A&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph UI 页面切换状态机\n        A[空闲状态] --&gt;|SwitchToPage| B{是否有当前页}\n        B --&gt;|有| C[旧页退出 + 新页进入]\n        B --&gt;|无| D[新页直接进入]\n        C --&gt; E[旧页禁用]\n        E --&gt; A\n        D --&gt; A\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((UI 动画))&#10;    Animator 驱动&#10;      关键帧录制&#10;      状态机控制&#10;      Unscaled Time 暂停支持&#10;    补间动画&#10;      属性插值计算&#10;      缓动函数库&#10;      链式 API 调用&#10;    CanvasGroup&#10;      批量透明度控制&#10;      交互性开关&#10;      嵌套 alpha 乘积&#10;    动画编排&#10;      页面切换状态机&#10;      进入退出衔接&#10;      防重入保护\">mindmap\n  root((UI 动画))\n    Animator 驱动\n      关键帧录制\n      状态机控制\n      Unscaled Time 暂停支持\n    补间动画\n      属性插值计算\n      缓动函数库\n      链式 API 调用\n    CanvasGroup\n      批量透明度控制\n      交互性开关\n      嵌套 alpha 乘积\n    动画编排\n      页面切换状态机\n      进入退出衔接\n      防重入保护</pre><ul>\n<li>Animator 适合复杂的多步骤 UI 动画序列，设计师可通过 Animation 窗口直接编辑</li>\n<li>代码驱动的补间动画灵活性最高，缓动函数决定动画的运动质感</li>\n<li>CanvasGroup 是批量控制 UI 透明度和交互性的核心组件，实现淡入淡出最简单</li>\n<li>UI 状态机模式确保多面板切换动画的正确衔接，防止快速切换导致的状态混乱</li>\n<li>暂停菜单等 UI 动画需使用 Unscaled Time 模式，不受 Time.timeScale 影响</li>\n<li>动画缓存和复用策略可以降低 GC 压力，避免在动画过程中频繁分配内存</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"UI 动画","id":"ui-动画"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Animator 驱动的 UI 动画","id":"animator-驱动的-ui-动画"},{"level":2,"text":"代码驱动的补间动画","id":"代码驱动的补间动画"},{"level":2,"text":"CanvasGroup 与批量控制","id":"canvasgroup-与批量控制"},{"level":2,"text":"UI 状态机与动画编排","id":"ui-状态机与动画编排"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"UI Toolkit (Unity 现代 UI 框架)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-ui/ui-toolkit"},"next":{"title":"UI 性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-ui/ui-optimization"}}